  "source_notice": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <title>Termination Restricted to Right-Forward Closures - Archive of Formal Proofs</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Termination Restricted to Right-Forward Closures in the Archive of Formal Proofs\">\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Termination Restricted to Right-Forward Closures in the Archive of Formal Proofs\">\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Termination Restricted to Right-Forward Closures\">\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://isa-afp.org/entries/Right_Forward_Closures.html\">\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://isa-afp.org/images/afp.png\">\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"../css/front.min.css\">\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"../images/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/icon\">\n    \n    <script>\n      MathJax = {\n        tex: {\n          inlineMath: [[\"$\", \"$\"], [\"\\\\(\", \"\\\\)\"]]\n        },\n        processEscapes: true,\n        svg: {\n          fontCache: \"global\"\n        }\n      };\n    </script>\n    <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"../js/mathjax/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n    </script>\n\n  <script src=\"../js/library.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"../js/flexsearch.bundle.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"../js/search-autocomplete.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"../js/obfuscate.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"../js/entries.js\"></script>\n</head>\n\n  <body class=\"mathjax_ignore\">\n    <aside><div id=\"menu-toggle\">\n  <input id=\"toggle\" type=\"checkbox\">\n  <label for=\"toggle\">\n    <span>menu</span>\n    <img src=\"../images/menu.svg\" alt=\"Menu\">\n  </label>\n  <a href=\"../\" class=\"logo-link\">\n    <img src=\"../images/afp.png\" alt=\"Logo of the Archive of Formal Proofs\" class=\"logo\">\n  </a>\n  <nav id=\"menu\">\n    <div>\n      <a href=\"../\" class=\"logo-link\">\n        <img src=\"../images/afp.png\" alt=\"Logo of the Archive of Formal Proofs\" class=\"logo\">\n      </a>\n      <ul>\n          <li >\n            <a href=\"../\">Home</a>\n          </li>\n          <li >\n            <a href=\"../topics/\">Topics</a>\n          </li>\n          <li >\n            <a href=\"../download/\">Download</a>\n          </li>\n          <li >\n            <a href=\"../help/\">Help</a>\n          </li>\n          <li >\n            <a href=\"../submission/\">Submission</a>\n          </li>\n          <li >\n            <a href=\"../statistics/\">Statistics</a>\n          </li>\n          <li >\n            <a href=\"../about/\">About</a>\n          </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n</div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <div class=\"content entries\"><header>\n    <form autocomplete=\"off\" action=\"../search/\">\n      <div class=\"form-container\">\n        <input id=\"search-input\" name=\"s\" type=\"search\" size=\"31\" maxlength=\"255\" value=\"\"\n               aria-label=\"Search the AFP\" list=\"autocomplete\"><button id=\"search-button\" type=\"submit\">\n          <img src=\"../images/search.svg\" alt=\"Search\">\n        </button>\n        <datalist id=\"autocomplete\"></datalist>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n  <h1>\n    <span class='first'>T</span>ermination <span class='first'>R</span>estricted to <span class='first'>R</span>ight-<span class='first'>F</span>orward <span class='first'>C</span>losures\n  </h1>\n  <div>\n      <p><a href=\"../authors/thiemann/\">René Thiemann</a> <a class=\"obfuscated\" data=\"eyJ1c2VyIjpbInJlbmUiLCJ0aGllbWFubiJdLCJob3N0IjpbInVpYmsiLCJhYyIsImF0Il19\">📧</a>, <a href=\"../authors/hofbauer/\">Dieter Hofbauer</a> <a class=\"obfuscated\" data=\"eyJ1c2VyIjpbIm1lc3NhZ2UiXSwiaG9zdCI6WyJkaWV0ZXItaG9mYmF1ZXIiLCJkZSJdfQ==\">📧</a>, <a href=\"../authors/huitouze/\">Ulysse Le Huitouze</a> and <a href=\"../authors/waldmannj/\">Johannes Waldmann</a> <a class=\"obfuscated\" data=\"eyJ1c2VyIjpbImpvaGFubmVzIiwid2FsZG1hbm4iXSwiaG9zdCI6WyJodHdrLWxlaXB6aWciLCJkZSJdfQ==\">📧</a>\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"date\">July 17, 2026</p>\n  </div>\n</header>\n      <div>\n  <main>\n\n    <h3>Abstract</h3>\n    <div class=\"abstract mathjax_process\">In this AFP entry we formalize Dershowitz' theorem that termination of a term\nrewrite system (TRS) starting from arbitrary terms is equivalent to termination\nstarting from terms in the right-forward closures of right-hand sides, provided\nthat the TRS is right-linear or orthogonal. Our proof deviates from the original\none in that no reorderings of steps in infinite derivations are required, making\nit more precise in its argumentation. We also integrate a later result that one\ncan weaken orthogonality to locally confluent overlay TRSs. \n<br/>  \nIn order to arrive at these statements, we had to formalize two further results:\nFollowing Gramlich, we prove that for locally confluent overlay TRSs the notions\nof termination and innermost termination coincide; and we verify that narrowing\nwith a right-linear TRS preserves linearity of terms.\n<br/>  \nFor further details, we refer to our FSCD 2026 paper.</div>\n\n    <h3>License</h3>\n    <div>\n        <a href=\"https://isa-afp.org/LICENSE\">BSD License</a>\n    </div>\n      <h3>Topics</h3>\n      <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"../topics/logic/rewriting/\">Logic/Rewriting</a></li>\n      </ul>\n      <h3>Related publications</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Thiemann, R., Hofbauer, D., Le Huitouze, U., &amp; Waldmann, J. (2026). New and Formalized Proofs for Right-Forward Closures and Core Matrix Interpretations. In F. Pfenning (Ed.), <i>LIPIcs, Volume 378, FSCD 2026</i> (No. 32; Vol. 378, pp. 32:1–32:19). Schloss Dagstuhl – Leibniz-Zentrum für Informatik. https://doi.org/10.4230/LIPICS.FSCD.2026.32</li>\n      </ul>\n      <h3>Session Right_Forward_Closures</h3>\n      <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"../thys/Right_Forward_Closures/Innermost_Rewriting.html\">Innermost_Rewriting</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"../thys/Right_Forward_Closures/Gramlich_Innermost_Switch.html\">Gramlich_Innermost_Switch</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"../thys/Right_Forward_Closures/Linear_Unification.html\">Linear_Unification</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"../thys/Right_Forward_Closures/Linear_Narrowing.html\">Linear_Narrowing</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"../thys/Right_Forward_Closures/Right_Forward_Closure.html\">Right_Forward_Closure</a></li>\n      </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"flex-wrap\">\n        <div>\n          <h3>Depends on</h3>\n          <ul class=\"horizontal-list\">\n              <li><a href=\"../entries/First_Order_Rewriting.html\">First-Order Rewriting</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <nav class=\"links\">\n    <a class=\"popup-button\" href=\"#cite-popup\">Cite</a>\n    <a class=\"popup-button\" href=\"#download-popup\">Download</a>\n    <h4>PDFs</h4>\n    <a href=\"https://isa-afp.org/browser_info/current/AFP/Right_Forward_Closures/outline.pdf\">Proof outline</a>\n    <a href=\"https://isa-afp.org/browser_info/current/AFP/Right_Forward_Closures/document.pdf\">Proof document</a>\n    <a href=\"https://isa-afp.org/browser_info/current/AFP/Right_Forward_Closures/session_graph.pdf\">Dependencies</a>\n  </nav>\n\n  <div id=\"cite-popup\" class=\"overlay\">\n    <a class=\"cancel\" href=\"#\"></a>\n    <div class=\"popup\">\n      <h2>Cite</h2>\n      <a class=\"close\" href=\"#\">&times;</a>\n      <div>\n        <p style=\"display:none;\" id=\"bibtex-filename\">Right_Forward_Closures-AFP</p>\n        <pre id=\"copy-text\">@article{Right_Forward_Closures-AFP,\n  author  = {René Thiemann and Dieter Hofbauer and Ulysse Le Huitouze and Johannes Waldmann},\n  title   = {Termination Restricted to Right-Forward Closures},\n  journal = {Archive of Formal Proofs},\n  month   = {July},\n  year    = {2026},\n  note    = {\\url{https://isa-afp.org/entries/Righ